=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Levil} in the {p:Pioneers' Coalition} (E-8) for a cutscene to begin the Quest.
* Speak with {n:Ploh Trishbahk} at (K-9) in {z:Eastern Adoulin} for another cutscene.
** At this point the Quest will now show in your log.
* Go to {p:Escha - Ru'Aun} and examine the blue **???** at (H-10) at the top of the stairs to the left of the entrance for a cutscence. You will receive {@k} {k:Inert geomancy bell}.
* Return to {n:Ploh Trishbahk} for another cutscene.
* Meet {p:Arciela}, {p:Ygnas}, and {p:Darrcuiln} in {z:Kamihr Drifts} at (H-5), and examine the **Alpine Trail** for a cutscene. This will take you into a zone named **Mount Kamihr**.
** This is the very most northern-middle point on the map.
*** The fastest way there is take Bivouac #3, go into the northern tunnel and follow the left wall, always heading north.
** Selecting the options "__Lifestream__" then "__Communion__" continues the conversation in a constructive way.
* Venture to the Crag closest to your home {z:Nation} (current allegiance, not starting nation) and click the **Ergon Locus ???** located beneath the stairs leading up to the {p:Telepoint} to obtain {@k} {k:Fistful of familiar soil} and view a cutscene.
** If you are in the middle of {q:Dances with Luopans|Dances with Luopans|Dances with Luopans} and have not received a {@k} {p:Luopan}, you need to turn the {@k} {k:Fistful of familiar soil} into a {@k} {p:Luopan} first, then go get another {@k} {k:Fistful of familiar soil} for the cutscene.
** Cannot be obtained while possessing {@k} {k:Holla crystal of gales}, {@k} {k:Dem crystal of dunes}, or {@k} {k:Mea crystal of flames} from {q:Treasures of the Earth|Treasures of the Earth|Treasures of the Earth} of the same type.
*** e.g. having the Holla crystal prevents obtaining the {k:Fistful of familiar soil} from the {p:Crag of Holla} **Ergon Locus ???**.
* Enter {z:Leafallia} for a cutscene.
* Examine the glowing spot **Drifting Feather** at (H-7) for another cutscene.
* Examine the **Drifting Feather** again to enter a BCNM.
** Your opponent will be {m:Siren Prime}.
*** The fight is Content Level 119.
*** {p:Trusts|Trust} may be used in the fight.
*** Siren absorbs Light Skillchains.
*** Siren has a move that can {p:Charm}.
* Upon defeating Siren, a cutscene will begin where you will be able to choose your reward.

----
